@startuml
title Domain core classes
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class UserAccount { accountId; verifiedEmail; credentialHash; status }
class Group { groupId; ownerId; currencyCode; precision }
class Membership { role; status; startAt; endAt }
class Expense { expenseId; submitterId; payerId; total: BigDecimal; date; status }
class ExpenseAllocation { participantId; percentage?; amount: BigDecimal }
class ReceiptReference { privateObjectRef; mediaType; size }
class Money { amount: BigDecimal; currencyCode; scale }
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" Membership
Group "1" -- "1..*" Membership
Group "1" -- "0..*" Expense
Expense "1" *-- "1..*" ExpenseAllocation
Expense "1" *-- "0..*" ReceiptReference
Expense --> Money
note right of Expense: Payer may be a participant. Own share nets to zero.
@enduml
